      "message": "fix(avoid): sweep vertical arcs, restore Field::new, cache avoid overlay, and merge upstream/main\n\nMerge upstream/main (83867fd71) keeping v68/v69 format barriers (stepping Do not touch to v70), cut_levels_under, air_stock/pocket3d_open_prev, and DrillUndersize alongside Do not touch.\n\n- sim::verify::avoid: sweep Move::segments3(ARC_SAG) chords widened by Bulge::deviation() for all arcs including XZ/YZ vertical arcs; add vertical arc between-sample contact pin.\n- motion::machining3d::shell: restore Field::new(facets) used by crossing_hop_tests.\n- ui::avoid_viz: memoize 3D protection geometry and projected viewport marks keyed by picks, model handles/features/facets/hidden/pose, and MVP bits; wrap paint in frame_cost::time(\"ui/viewport.avoid_marks\"); add still-frame and changed-input counter tests.\n\nFixes #2055",
